\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Pairwise inter-method agreement (Cohen's $\kappa $) on the Schleiermacher Digital register. Three internally tight clusters are visible (HIVOTO/HIVOTO-XGB/nomquamgender, the dictionary methods gender-guesser/Wiki-Gendersort, and the two transformers); the LLM sits apart from all three. GND and the parenthetical-qualifier rule are excluded because their coverage overlap with the name-based methods is too small for a stable pairwise estimate.}}{9}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:kappa-heatmap}{{1}{9}{Pairwise inter-method agreement (Cohen's $\kappa $) on the Schleiermacher Digital register. Three internally tight clusters are visible (HIVOTO/HIVOTO-XGB/nomquamgender, the dictionary methods gender-guesser/Wiki-Gendersort, and the two transformers); the LLM sits apart from all three. GND and the parenthetical-qualifier rule are excluded because their coverage overlap with the name-based methods is too small for a stable pairwise estimate}{figure.1}{}}
